if your mod already has modified topbar, you can copy this manually instead of figuring out how to port our modified "topbar.gui".

You can put this under "button_speedup" in topbar.gui  

		guiButtonType = {
			name = "button_fe_player_pause"
			quadTextureSprite ="GFX_button_player_pause"
			tooltip = ""
			tooltipText =""
			delayedTooltipText = ""
			position = { x = 161 y = 127 }
		}

		guiButtonType = {
